N M
A_1 A_2 \dots A_N

Output

Print the answer.

Constraints


- 1 \leq N, M \leq 2025
- 1 \leq A_i \leq N
- All input values are integers.

Sample Input 1

3 3
2 1 1

Sample Output 1

6

The sequences x=(1,1,1),(2,2,1),(2,2,2),(3,3,1),(3,3,2),(3,3,3) satisfy the condition.

